;; §3 — DOCTRINES ESTABLISHED THIS SESSION (10 memory files, cited)
;; ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

(doctrines-established
  ((:name "cpt-serves-sft-2026-07-21"
    :claim "CPT is scaffolding. SFT is the deliverable. Success is measured at SFT layer, not CPT layer.")

   (:name "no-sealed-corpus-2026-07-21"
    :claim "A CPT corpus cannot be sealed. Training is global — injecting on axis X shifts axes Y+Z+downstream (FIM, code priors). Design for differential attachment as physics, not a bug.")

   (:name "axes-are-authoring-not-testing-2026-07-21"
    :claim "The 4 Jung axes organize corpus authoring. They are NOT a runtime behavior the model must exhibit. Do not probe per-axis retrieval as a ship-gate.")

   (:name "llm-finetuning-is-art-not-science-2026-07-21"
    :claim "At our scale, LLM fine-tuning is craft, not science. Base training data is opaque; recipes are heuristics not laws. HF sells the trial workshop, not a science.")

   (:name "sft-must-be-abductive-2026-07-21"
    :claim "Every SFT pair shape: observation → candidate explanations → best-fit landing. Peirce's abduction is the meta-shape. Declarative Q→A locks into phrase-surface overfit.")

   (:name "philosophers-as-sft-shapes-2026-07-21"
    :claim "The 16 philosophers Motoi wove throughout the corpus each contribute a specific SFT reasoning shape. 5 core weight-heavy + 10 woven.")

   (:name "isb-sft-novelty-composition-2026-07-21"
    :claim "Five-way composition of pedagogical mechanisms on densely-labeled corpus. First-time-in-history claim.")

   (:name "tracking-off-no-grief-2026-07-21"
    :claim "Some Forge/SRE tool cards show tracking-off/stale/connecting indicators. Treat as informational, not alarms.")

   (:name "mk2-sft-plan-2026-07-21"
    :claim "Initial SFT plan (superseded by ISB-SFT synthesis; contents preserved as history).")

   (:name "direct-execution-over-sub-agents-2026-07-21"
    :claim "When Alfred has nothing to add and it's execution-only, do it directly. Lacuna Eng personas are for audit/planning, not code execution.")))


