(alfred-directives-preserved
  ("MAXIMALLY — not half-ass first + iterate. Do the real thing once."
   "First time in history — proper pedagogical composition, not distilled generic recipe"
   "Central substrate over-trained; edges will be weaker; accept as design choice"
   "SFT is EDUCATION — K-12 through college through master's through PhD"
   "ALL 16 philosophers covered (5 core weight-heavy + 10 woven-as-tags)"
   "ALL Tier 1 + Tier 2 + Tier 3 graph nodes used — labeling investment honored"
   "ALL 1,125 reference verbs, not first 460"
   "ALL 1,285 wired carts — labeled work honored"
   "Snapshot CPT adapter before training (DONE)"
   "PING when data ready for review — BEFORE training fires"
   "Alfred reviews balance report + approves"
   "THEN PING when training fires + at completion"
   "Document repeatable procedure in SRE + Weave AFTER this run's ship-gate results confirm"))


;; ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
;; §12 — CURRENT STATE (as of 2026-07-21 ~16:40 local)
