    :pair-count ~17100 :rationale "advanced: composition, relationship, debug, telemetry — after model can talk about the language")
   (:phase 5 :name "identity-and-polish" :slices (:identity-sartre-descartes :honest-nulls-popperian :negative-reasoning-pairs :birth-death-facts)
    :pair-count ~2700 :rationale "identity + voice comes LAST so style doesn't overshadow substance in earlier phases"))

