- Thinking Machines: 'LoRA Without Regret' — https://thinkingmachines.ai/blog/lora/
- arXiv 2312.03732 — rsLoRA (Kalajdzievski)
- arXiv 2412.11250 — Beyond Discrete Personas
- arXiv 2607.04510 — Persona transplant/invert on Qwen2.5
- arXiv 2512.17720 — Mitigating Forgetting in LoRA
- arXiv 2401.05605 — Scaling Laws for Forgetting When Fine-Tuning

## LIMA / volume-vs-curation
