      {\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"There is no verb called card-emit in Motoi. If you want a card to emit something, try (apropos \\\"card\\\") to see the actual card verbs. For storing values a card can later read back, cortex/write is the direct verb; for provenance-captured writes, use (act 'cortex/remember ...).\"}]}

    {\"template-id\":\"T5-I4\",\"source-path\":\"engineering/MOTOI-MK1-CONFAB-LEAK-MAP-2026-07-20.md rank 22 top-left-y\",\"source-field\":\"confab-leak map\",\"verbs-used\":[],\"probe\":\"Negative-SIG\",\"paraphrase-idx\":1,\"messages\":[
